<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  BladeWatch-81g9.2: the native in-car UI is gone. `net.bladewatch.flutter` owns every
  in-car string now, in `flutter_ui/lib/l10n/app_*.arb`.

  What remains is ONLY what the daemon APK itself still renders, and every key here has a
  live consumer, verified by scanning the surviving sources and resources:

    * AndroidManifest             service_host_label (the <application> label). NOT app_name:
                                  this APK has no launcher icon and must not share a name with
                                  net.bladewatch.flutter, or BYD's app-start dialog shows two
                                  identical rows. See BladeWatch-8h7m.
    * app_name                    kept as the product name; no code reads it today
    * res/xml accessibility cfg   accessibility_service_description
    * StatusOverlayService        status_overlay_notif_*, overlay_*_inactive_label,
                                  cd_recording_status, cd_trip_tracking_status
                                  (+ res/layout/overlay_status.xml)
    * SetupGuideDialog            setup_*, action_done, action_remind_me_later,
                                  cd_permission_granted, cd_step_completed
                                  (+ res/layout/dialog_setup_guide.xml)
    * MainActivity                toast_storage_permission_required

  Pruned from 618. Do NOT add in-car UI strings back here: a second copy of a translated
  string is how two catalogs drift apart.
-->
